#sortorder:3
#showas:尖塔 B - 陨落之友崛起
A more specialist scenario. Mainly you and two AIs, and it's set to difficulty 7.

This is on the "Clusters" map type, with 80 planets. Full Ensemble AI type in both cases.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

The main component of this one is Fallen Spire, the traditional way to play with Spire.  Spire gameplay focuses heavily on much larger battles, with numerous super units, and another way to win the game.

This can play very differently from normal, and is not recommended for new players.  